<trans-unit id="s40911ccca1e188f3">
  <source>What is Yordle?</source>
  <target>什么是Yordle？</target>
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="sff04f4a8484bac26">
  <source>How do I shorten a link?</source>
  <target>我怎样才能缩短一个网址？</target>
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="s352719d86112de9a">
  <source>Help</source>
  <target>帮助</target>
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="h40cb2fc65a176dc6">
  <source>Powered by
            <x id="0" equiv-text="&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/qqiao/yordle&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;"/>Yordle<x id="1" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/></source>
  <target>动力来自<x id="0" equiv-text="&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/qqiao/yordle&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;"/>Yordle<x id="1" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/></target>
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="hef59218ecccc834c">
  <source><x id="0" equiv-text="&lt;p&gt;"/>
              Yordle allows you to shorten URLs so that they are easier to share
              with people. For example, the following URL
              <x id="1" equiv-text="&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;"/>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ<x id="2" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/>
              can be shortened to
              <x id="3" equiv-text="&lt;a href=&quot;/PmYUlTPea&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;${BASE_URL}"/>/PmYUlTPea<x id="4" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/>, which can be shared more easily.
            <x id="5" equiv-text="&lt;/p&gt;"/></source>
  <target><x id="0" equiv-text="&lt;p&gt;"/>
              Yordle 可以缩短网址，让您更轻松地与他人分享。例如，以下网址
              <x id="1" equiv-text="&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;"/>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ<x id="2" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/>
              可以缩短为
              <x id="3" equiv-text="&lt;a href=&quot;/PmYUlTPea&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;${BASE_URL}"/>/PmYUlTPea<x id="4" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/>，从而更方便地分享。
            <x id="5" equiv-text="&lt;/p&gt;"/></target>
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="h8664bdefaa3edc21">
  <source><x id="0" equiv-text="&lt;p&gt;"/>
                To shorten a link, paste in the long URL in the text box labeled
                'Your original URL here', then click on the 'Shorten URL'
                button.
              <x id="1" equiv-text="&lt;/p&gt;&#10;              &lt;p&gt;"/>
                A new dialog box will show up with the shortened URL. Click on
                the 'Copy' button to copy it to your clipboard so that it can be
                shared, emailed or tweeted.
              <x id="2" equiv-text="&lt;/p&gt;"/></source>
  <target><x id="0" equiv-text="&lt;p&gt;"/>
                要缩短链接，请将长网址粘贴到标有“在此输入原始网址”的文本框中，然后点击“缩短网址”按钮。
              <x id="1" equiv-text="&lt;/p&gt;&#10;              &lt;p&gt;"/>
                随后会弹出一个显示短网址的新对话框。点击“复制”按钮将其复制到剪贴板，即可分享、发送邮件或发布推文。
              <x id="2" equiv-text="&lt;/p&gt;"/></target>
</trans-unit>
